# Each of these is a URL somebody plausibly links to or bookmarks. None of
# them was ever a live page on this site — the treatments, the areas and the
# booking paths all moved in the 2026-11-10 restructure — so they are
# answered with a redirect to the page that now owns the intent rather than
# a 404. A redirect preserves whatever link equity pointed at them.
#
